# 누가 어떤 토픽에 발행할 수 있는지. 읽기는 모두 가능.
pattern read home/#
pattern write home/status/%u

user door
topic write home/door/#
# 허브 다운 시 이어받기: 허브가 쓰는 토픽도 발행
topic write home/state/#
topic write home/alert
topic write home/cmd/living/#

user living
topic write home/living/#

user hub
topic write home/state/#
topic write home/alert
topic write home/cmd/living/#

# 명령은 월패드와 폰만
user wallpad
topic write home/cmd/mode
topic write home/cmd/approve
topic write home/cmd/dismiss

user phone
topic write home/cmd/mode
topic write home/cmd/approve
topic write home/cmd/dismiss
